<h2 id="views">Step 7: The Views</h2>
<p>Views go in <code>views/recipes/</code>. They extend the theme's layout, which already prints flash messages and loads the React bridge, so these templates only describe their own content. Twig escapes every <code>&#123;&#123; &#125;&#125;</code> value automatically.</p>

